text Aren't you my father?
text Are you just a conversation partner? Is that all you are?
text Or are you trying to take the friend I'm bringing over and involve them in this too?
text I want to ask him these questions.
text And I want him to have answers.
sound GOJ.aac
text @[Father]
text I'm good at these kinds of things.
text My father grabs one of the bamboo sticks.
text @[Tomoya]
text Stop it!
text I rush over and pull his arm away.
