text ...
text My father looks up at my face, equal parts confused and shocked.
text @[Tomoya]
text Just stop it...
text @[Tomoya]
text This doesn't have anything to do with you.
text I use the best words I can for the situation.
sound GOL.aac
text @[Father]
text ...
text He hangs his head, just as I expect him to.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
