	fi
fi
text But even so, he still looks like he's trying to spite me.
text He looks like someone who's just hurt a friend... not his own child.
text I begin to frantically gather the dango that are spread out across the table.
text I stuff them into the supermarket bag and leave the room without so much as another glance at my father.
