text @[Tomoya]
text *Pant* *Pant*
text My breath is getting heavy. My lungs burn, starved for oxygen.
text My entire body is assaulted by an intense feeling of fatigue.
text I don't even know what it must look like to see me running.
text I'd come all the way here before even realizing that I'd practically sprinted down the street.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah...
