text Yes?
text She replies.
text But... I'm not able to say anything.
text What is it that I wanted to do...?
sound GON.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text ...?
text She tilts her head to the side.
text I stand there, breathless.
sound GOO.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Are you tired?
text @[Tomoya]
text No, not really...
sound GOP.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Um, what's that?
text The question finally causes me to remember it.
text The supermarket bag that I'm carrying in my hand, that is.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh... this? You can have it.
text Furukawa takes it and peeks inside.
text It should be packed full of dango with little faces on them.
